# Mainline FUSE backing-open requires CAP_SYS_ADMIN, which MediaProvider does
# not and must not receive. Cuttlefish's enabled passthrough setting otherwise
# turns ordinary /sdcard CREATE/OPEN into EPERM -> EFAULT on this board.
# Run after persistent properties load, so an old userdata value cannot undo
# the fix. Keep this on system_ext: vendor_init cannot set this system property.
# TODO: Re-enable only after an Android-compatible delegated passthrough ABI
# is implemented and tested with MediaProvider's unchanged credentials.
on property:ro.persistent_properties.ready=true && property:persist.sys.fuse.passthrough.enable=true
    setprop persist.sys.fuse.passthrough.enable false
